  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Restoration of the livelihoods of vulnerable households affected by the escalation of the security and humanitarian crisis in Haiti.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of FAO?s intervention is to ensure that urban and peri-urban populations affected by the crisis in the Metropolitan Area of Port-au-Prince and in the Grand&apos;Anse and Artibonite departments can meet their basic needs and sustain their livelihoods. The strategy is designed to improve and support the livelihoods of IDPs, host communities and other vulnerable households, including those in food emergencies (IPC phase 4).</narrative>
  </description>
